{"seq":3,"slug":"remote-sensing-basics","title":"遥感数据分析基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/applied-geospatial/remote-sensing-basics","wordCount":1198,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"遥感数据分析基础\">遥感数据分析基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>遥感（Remote Sensing）是通过卫星或航空平台获取地表信息的技术。遥感数据以栅格影像的形式记录不同波段的电磁辐射，通过光谱特征分析可以识别地表覆盖类型、植被健康状况、城市扩张等信息。遥感是地球观测、环境监测和资源调查的核心技术手段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[遥感数据分析] --&gt; B[数据获取]&#10;    A --&gt; C[预处理]&#10;    A --&gt; D[分类与提取]&#10;    B --&gt; E[光学遥感]&#10;    B --&gt; F[雷达遥感]&#10;    B --&gt; G[高光谱]&#10;    C --&gt; H[辐射校正]&#10;    C --&gt; I[大气校正]&#10;    C --&gt; J[几何校正]&#10;    D --&gt; K[监督分类]&#10;    D --&gt; L[非监督分类]&#10;    D --&gt; M[指数计算]\">graph TD\n    A[遥感数据分析] --&gt; B[数据获取]\n    A --&gt; C[预处理]\n    A --&gt; D[分类与提取]\n    B --&gt; E[光学遥感]\n    B --&gt; F[雷达遥感]\n    B --&gt; G[高光谱]\n    C --&gt; H[辐射校正]\n    C --&gt; I[大气校正]\n    C --&gt; J[几何校正]\n    D --&gt; K[监督分类]\n    D --&gt; L[非监督分类]\n    D --&gt; M[指数计算]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>遥感数据源</th>\n<th>空间分辨率</th>\n<th>重访周期</th>\n<th>波段</th>\n<th>免费获取</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Landsat 8/9</td>\n<td>30m（全色 15m）</td>\n<td>16 天</td>\n<td>11 波段</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>土地利用变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sentinel-2</td>\n<td>10-60m</td>\n<td>5 天</td>\n<td>13 波段</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>农业监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MODIS</td>\n<td>250-1000m</td>\n<td>1-2 天</td>\n<td>36 波段</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>全球植被监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PlanetScope</td>\n<td>3m</td>\n<td>每日</td>\n<td>4-8 波段</td>\n<td>商业</td>\n<td>精细监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高分系列</td>\n<td>1-8m</td>\n<td>4-41 天</td>\n<td>4-多光谱</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>国产高分辨率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"电磁波谱与光谱特征\">电磁波谱与光谱特征</h2><p>遥感的物理基础是地物对不同波段电磁辐射的反射、吸收和发射差异。理解光谱特征是正确解译遥感影像的前提。</p>\n<p>植被在可见光红波段（620-690nm）有强吸收（叶绿素吸收），在近红外波段（760-900nm）有强反射（叶片细胞结构散射）——这一&quot;红边&quot;特征是植被遥感的基础。水体在近红外及更长波段几乎完全吸收，反射率极低。裸土在各波段的反射率相对均匀且随波长缓慢上升。城市不透水面在各波段反射率中等偏高。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波段范围</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>主要信息</th>\n<th>穿透能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>400-700nm</td>\n<td>可见光</td>\n<td>颜色、叶绿素</td>\n<td>无云层穿透</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>700-1100nm</td>\n<td>近红外</td>\n<td>植被结构、水体识别</td>\n<td>无云层穿透</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1100-2500nm</td>\n<td>短波红外</td>\n<td>土壤湿度、矿物</td>\n<td>无云层穿透</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3-14μm</td>\n<td>热红外</td>\n<td>地表温度</td>\n<td>无云层穿透</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1mm-1m</td>\n<td>微波</td>\n<td>地形、冰雪、湿度</td>\n<td>全天候穿透</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"遥感指数计算\">遥感指数计算</h2><h3 id=\"植被指数\">植被指数</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import rasterio&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;with rasterio.open(&quot;sentinel2_B04.tif&quot;) as red_src:&#10;    red = red_src.read(1).astype(np.float32)&#10;    profile = red_src.profile&#10;&#10;with rasterio.open(&quot;sentinel2_B08.tif&quot;) as nir_src:&#10;    nir = nir_src.read(1).astype(np.float32)&#10;&#10;ndvi = (nir - red) / (nir + red + 1e-10)&#10;&#10;ndvi = np.clip(ndvi, -1, 1)&#10;&#10;profile.update(dtype=rasterio.float32, count=1)&#10;with rasterio.open(&quot;ndvi.tif&quot;, &#39;w&#39;, **profile) as dst:&#10;    dst.write(ndvi, 1)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rasterio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rasterio.open(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sentinel2_B04.tif\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> red_src:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    red </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> red_src.read(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).astype(np.float32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    profile </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> red_src.profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rasterio.open(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sentinel2_B08.tif\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nir_src:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    nir </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nir_src.read(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).astype(np.float32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ndvi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nir </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> red) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nir </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> red </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e-10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ndvi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.clip(ndvi, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">profile.update(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rasterio.float32, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rasterio.open(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ndvi.tif\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'w'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">profile) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dst:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dst.write(ndvi, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>遥感指数</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>值域</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NDVI</td>\n<td>(NIR-Red)/(NIR+Red)</td>\n<td>植被覆盖</td>\n<td>[-1, 1]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NDWI</td>\n<td>(Green-NIR)/(Green+NIR)</td>\n<td>水体识别</td>\n<td>[-1, 1]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NDBI</td>\n<td>(SWIR-NIR)/(SWIR+NIR)</td>\n<td>建筑用地</td>\n<td>[-1, 1]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EVI</td>\n<td>2.5×(NIR-Red)/(NIR+6Red-7.5Blue+1)</td>\n<td>增强植被</td>\n<td>[-1, 1]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LST</td>\n<td>热红外反演</td>\n<td>地表温度</td>\n<td>K</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>NDVI 是最基础的植被指数，但在高密度植被区域容易饱和。EVI 通过引入蓝光波段校正大气和土壤背景的影响，在高植被覆盖区域的灵敏度优于 NDVI。NDWI 利用绿光和近红外的差异有效区分水体和陆地。多指数联合分析可以更准确地分类地表覆盖类型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"影像分类\">影像分类</h2><h3 id=\"监督分类\">监督分类</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier&#10;from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split&#10;&#10;with rasterio.open(&quot;multiband.tif&quot;) as src:&#10;    bands = src.read()&#10;    rows, cols = bands.shape[1], bands.shape[2]&#10;&#10;pixels = bands.reshape(bands.shape[0], -1).T  # (n_pixels, n_bands)&#10;&#10;import geopandas as gpd&#10;training = gpd.read_file(&quot;training_samples.shp&quot;)&#10;&#10;X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(&#10;    sample_features, sample_labels, test_size=0.3, random_state=42&#10;)&#10;&#10;clf = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=100, random_state=42)&#10;clf.fit(X_train, y_train)&#10;&#10;classified = clf.predict(pixels).reshape(rows, cols)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.ensemble </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomForestClassifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.model_selection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_test_split</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rasterio.open(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"multiband.tif\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> src:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bands </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> src.read()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rows, cols </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bands.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], bands.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pixels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bands.reshape(bands.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).T  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># (n_pixels, n_bands)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> geopandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">training </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd.read_file(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"training_samples.shp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_test_split(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sample_features, sample_labels, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">test_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">clf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomForestClassifier(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_estimators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">clf.fit(X_train, y_train)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">classified </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clf.predict(pixels).reshape(rows, cols)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类方法</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>训练数据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最大似然</td>\n<td>监督</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>传统分类</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机森林</td>\n<td>监督</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>多波段分类</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SVM</td>\n<td>监督</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高光谱</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K-Means</td>\n<td>非监督</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>探索性分析</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度学习</td>\n<td>监督</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高分辨率</td>\n<td>大量标注</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分类精度评估使用混淆矩阵，从中计算总体精度（Overall Accuracy）、Kappa 系数、各类别的用户精度（User&#39;s Accuracy）和生产者精度（Producer&#39;s Accuracy）。总体精度反映整体分类质量，Kappa 系数排除了随机一致性的影响。用户精度衡量分类结果的可靠性（从结果看有多少是正确的），生产者精度衡量地物被正确识别的概率（从真实类别看有多少被找到）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"google-earth-engine\">Google Earth Engine</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import ee&#10;ee.Initialize()&#10;&#10;image = ee.ImageCollection(&#39;COPERNICUS/S2_SR&#39;) \\&#10;    .filterDate(&#39;2024-06-01&#39;, &#39;2024-08-31&#39;) \\&#10;    .filterBounds(ee.Geometry.Point([116.4, 39.9])) \\&#10;    .filter(ee.Filter.lt(&#39;CLOUDY_PIXEL_PERCENTAGE&#39;, 10)) \\&#10;    .median()&#10;&#10;ndvi = image.normalizedDifference([&#39;B8&#39;, &#39;B4&#39;]).rename(&#39;NDVI&#39;)&#10;&#10;stats = ndvi.reduceRegion(&#10;    reducer=ee.Reducer.mean(),&#10;    geometry=roi,&#10;    scale=10,&#10;    maxPixels=1e9&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ee</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ee.Initialize()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">image </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ee.ImageCollection(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'COPERNICUS/S2_SR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .filterDate(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-06-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-08-31'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .filterBounds(ee.Geometry.Point([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">116.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">39.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])) \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .filter(ee.Filter.lt(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLOUDY_PIXEL_PERCENTAGE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .median()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ndvi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image.normalizedDifference([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'B8'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'B4'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]).rename(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NDVI'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ndvi.reduceRegion(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    reducer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ee.Reducer.mean(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    geometry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">roi,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxPixels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GEE 优势</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>云端处理</td>\n<td>PB 级数据无需下载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据丰富</td>\n<td>Landsat、Sentinel、MODIS 等完整归档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行计算</td>\n<td>自动分布式处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>免费使用</td>\n<td>学术和非商业免费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GEE 的编程模型是延迟计算（Lazy Evaluation）：代码定义计算图但不立即执行，调用 <code>getInfo()</code>、<code>reduceRegion()</code> 或导出时才触发服务端执行。这种模式要求避免在客户端循环中调用服务端计算——应尽量使用 <code>map()</code>、<code>reduce()</code> 等服务端操作保持计算在云端完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>遥感数据通过电磁波段记录地表信息，不同波段组合可提取植被、水体和建筑等特征</li>\n<li>理解地物光谱特征是遥感影像解译的基础，红边效应是植被遥感的核心原理</li>\n<li>NDVI 是最常用的植被指数，EVI 在高密度植被区域灵敏度更优</li>\n<li>影像分类分为监督和非监督两大类，随机森林是当前遥感分类的主流方法</li>\n<li>混淆矩阵和 Kappa 系数是分类精度评估的标准方法</li>\n<li>Google Earth Engine 提供 PB 级遥感数据的云端分析能力，是大尺度遥感分析的首选平台</li>\n<li>遥感预处理（辐射校正、大气校正）是保证分析质量的前提步骤</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"遥感数据分析基础","id":"遥感数据分析基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"电磁波谱与光谱特征","id":"电磁波谱与光谱特征"},{"level":2,"text":"遥感指数计算","id":"遥感指数计算"},{"level":3,"text":"植被指数","id":"植被指数"},{"level":2,"text":"影像分类","id":"影像分类"},{"level":3,"text":"监督分类","id":"监督分类"},{"level":2,"text":"Google Earth Engine","id":"google-earth-engine"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"地理空间可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/applied-geospatial/spatial-visualization"},"next":{"title":"空间机器学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/applied-geospatial/spatial-machine-learning"}}